# W31i, c (k10): in stag0201 with b; lets the notice of a's entry run out; 45 s after it (b's GO expired by then) it
# takes matz00 to stag0202 with b (the owner waits for two on the mat) and stays there. (It reaches matz00 by the test hook
# "testhook mat": stag0201's mummies felled it on its walk there in run f1 of the go lane.)
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@120
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log c in stag0201
idle until notices>=1 fail epoch>=@900
log c sees the notice
idle until frames>=2700 fail stagechange
testhook mat matz00 until frames>=30
mat matz00 yes 2 until stage=stag0202,control fail epoch>=@1100
log c in stag0202
idle until epoch>=@1250
log c done
